---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout_Sidebar.astro';
import Side from '@/components/about/Side.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- Sidebar -->
  <aside slot="aside">
    <Side isEn={true} />
  </aside>

  <!-- Content -->
  <article class="prose max-w-none">
    <h1>Vision, Mission and Organizational Core Values</h1><br>    
<h2>Vision</h2>
To be a leading international institute in Religious Studies that integrates religion, ethics, and modern knowledge to advance society toward sustainability in a rapidly changing world, grounded in moral integrity.
<br><br>

<h2>Mission</h2>

<ol style="list-style-type: decimal; padding-left:30px; margin-left:10px; line-height:1.8;">
  <li>
    To produce graduates endowed with wisdom and moral integrity, capable of integrating religion, ethics, and modern knowledge to live and work responsibly in a changing world.
  </li>
  <li>
    To generate interdisciplinary knowledge and innovation in religion, spirituality, and society in order to promote well-being, deepen understanding of life, and foster sustainable coexistence.
  </li>
  <li>
    To strengthen the role of religion in public policy and public discourse, empowering moral values and civic consciousness in society.
  </li>
  <li>
    To develop academic networks and communities of meaning, both nationally and internationally, in order to expand the transformative power of faith, understanding, and social healing.
  </li>
  <li>
    To enhance institutional governance, agile management systems, and financial sustainability in order to advance all missions on a foundation of integrity and sustainability.
  </li>
</ol>


<h2>Organizational Core Values</h2>

<p>
C - Compassion: Commitment to Compassion<br>
R - Resilience: Intellectual Strength<br>
S - Spirituality: Strength Rooted in Spirituality
</p>
<table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:inherit;">
  <thead>
    <tr style="background-color:#d9dde2;">
      <th style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px; text-align:left; width:20%;">Letter</th>
      <th colspan="2" style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px; text-align:center;">
        Institutional Meaning
      </th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">C - Compassion</td>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px; width:25%;">
        Compassion for Humanity and Society
      </td>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">
        Demonstrating care, understanding, and working to enhance quality of life and human dignity.
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">R - Resilience</td>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">
        Intellectual Strength
      </td>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">
        Applying reason, wisdom, and modern disciplines to navigate global change effectively.
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">S - Spirituality</td>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">
        Strength Rooted in Spirituality
      </td>
      <td style="border:1px solid #c8ccd1; padding:10px;">
        Living with meaning, remaining steadfast in challenges, and upholding moral integrity.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>



  </article>
</Layout>
